#~ msgstr "Mā te 0.0.0.0 ka taea te tūmau e ngā pūrere kei runga i tō whatunga ā-rohe; ka mau tonu te ārai a te ratonga i te ipurangi. Mā te 127.0.0.1 ka herea ki tēnei mīhini anake. Ka whakakāhoretia ngā tauranga 1024 me raro iho."

#~ msgid "local network only; internet blocked by the unit"
#~ msgstr "te whatunga ā-rohe anake; kua ārai te wae i te ipurangi"
